{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03914","headline":"奉和九日幸临渭亭登高应制得筵字 · 阎朝隐","name":"奉和九日幸临渭亭登高应制得筵字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九九侍神仙，高高坐半天。\n文章二曜动，气色五星连。\n簪绂趋皇极，笙歌接御筵。\n愿因茱菊酒，相守百千年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"阎朝隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03914.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03914","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}